    "summary": "A flowering plant native to Tunisia, Sardinia, Corsica, Sicily, Italy, Albania, Greece, the eastern Aegean Islands, Crete, Cyprus and Turkey, Malva cretica has been introduced to France. A possible subspecies may occur in Spain.",
